  "notes": "Cause code is TBD/provisional per FORM-366 fields, despite narrative providing a detailed root-cause discussion (conflicting TS/TS Bases/procedure guidance leading to a personnel/procedural misapplication). Block 13 was empty in the FORM-366 FIELDS input, so no Block13Row entries were populated. Movable incore detector system (IG) is modeled as INVOLVES because it directly participated in the event (only 1 of 5 available before the event, further reduced to loss of 3 more during the event) rather than pure design-context; it is not modeled as a BACKED_UP_BY relationship since it was NOT fully available during the inoperability window. Rod Control System [M] is modeled as INVOLVES since it was actively placed in manual as an event response action, not merely as design context. No manufacturer or system EIIS bracket code was given for the breaker or overcurrent device, so eiis_code left null per instructions. Docket/unit/plant were inferred from title text (garbled in FORM-366 identity) and narrative header repeatedly stating 'Beaver Valley Power Station, Unit 2' and docket 05000412."
